roperty with NaN as default value is displayed as 0.0 with revert button activated. The display issue is already addressed in commit `7d30a7b495e`. However, the revert button issue remains unresolved. This PR adds a simple patch in `PropertyUtils::is_property_value_different`.\r\n\r\n`PropertyUtils::is_property_value_different` appears to be the appropriate place. It compares a current value against a baseline value. Therefore, considering NaN equal to itself is expected. This does not change normal IEEE-754 or Variant equality semantics.\r\n\r\nRelated issue: #50715 \r\n\r\nbefore/after:\r\n<img width=\"931\" height=\"720\" alt=\"comparison\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9dd05d48-bf1d-4152-a053-16c67bf5d93f\" />","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar